{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/灵肉相宜","pageid":7366,"revid":17901,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%81%B5%E8%82%89%E7%9B%B8%E5%AE%9C&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%81%B5%E8%82%89%E7%9B%B8%E5%AE%9C&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%81%B5%E8%82%89%E7%9B%B8%E5%AE%9C&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>灵肉相宜</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E7.81.B5.E8.82.89.E7.9B.B8.E5.AE.9C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"灵肉相宜\"><b>灵肉相宜</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"技能 灵肉相宜.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/31/ds4u7u0gzwj6ixqy8bluoa0cck8xzlo.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%81%B5%E8%82%89%E7%9B%B8%E5%AE%9C.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/31/ds4u7u0gzwj6ixqy8bluoa0cck8xzlo.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%81%B5%E8%82%89%E7%9B%B8%E5%AE%9C.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/31/ds4u7u0gzwj6ixqy8bluoa0cck8xzlo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />灵肉相宜\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[被动]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（被动）行动结束时，强制选中生命值最低、距离最远的<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>名敌人，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>物攻值加魔攻值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物理伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"\">物理伤害</font></span></span>]。<br />✦攻击后，若敌人处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"濒死\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">濒死</font></span></span>]状态，则额外施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"晕眩\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">晕眩</font></span></span>]，并驱散目标所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">增益</span>]。<br />✦任意敌人行动开始时，自身获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">警醒</span>]，不可驱散，无法免疫。<br />✦自身行动结束时且拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">警醒</span>]，消耗所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">警醒</span>]，额外释放本技能攻击效果。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n